{"results":[{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/socialsansaar/posts/the-poster-highlights-a-sharp-satirical-remark-attributed-to-comedian-kunal-kamr/1950693799062925/","final_url":"https://www.facebook.com/socialsansaar/posts/the-poster-highlights-a-sharp-satirical-remark-attributed-to-comedian-kunal-kamr/1950693799062925/","title":"Social Sansaar","description":"The poster highlights a sharp satirical remark attributed to comedian Kunal Kamra, who uses humor to question how political power is exercised. The statement compares the current system to an old...","language":"en","text":"The poster highlights a sharp satirical remark attributed to comedian Kunal Kamra, who uses humor to question how political power is exercised. The statement compares the current system to an old tradition where one person’s name is used while another person actually performs the role. Through this comparison, Kamra appears to criticize what he sees as hidden influence, political control, and a lack of transparency in public life.\n\nPolitical satire has always played an important role in a democracy. It allows comedians, writers, journalists, and ordinary citizens to challenge leaders, raise uncomfortable questions, and encourage public discussion. However, serious political allegations should also be examined through facts, evidence, and constitutional processes rather than being accepted only because they become viral.\n\nSupporters may describe Kamra’s comment as fearless truth-telling, while critics may consider it exaggerated, offensive, or politically motivated. Either way, the remark shows how comedians and digital creators increasingly influence political conversations in India.\n\nPeople must have the freedom to question those in power, but public debate should remain peaceful, informed, and respectful. Democracy becomes stronger when citizens listen to different viewpoints and form opinions based on reliable information.\n\nWhat is your opinion on this political satire?\n\nAll reactions:\n\n871 comments\n\n72 shares\n\nLike\n\nComment\n\nMost relevant\n\n\n\nKuldeep Raj\n\nThis is a new Pappu\n\n20\n\nView 1 reply\n\nVijay Popat\n\nसरकार रामजी के आशीर्वाद से चल रही है, ये तो खुशीकी बात है ।\n\n45\n\nView all 4 replies\n\nVishwanath Singh\n\nYe Bhi to Naya jokar hai.\n\nBilkul naya\n\n34\n\nView 1 reply\n\nKrishan Patel Munna\n\nअब समझ में आने लगा है कि अशुरो का जन्म होने लगा है\n\n18\n\nPankaj Singh\n\nमै हिंदू हूं ,,लेकिन इसकी बात मे सच्चाई है ,,ये सही बोला है\n\n18\n\nView all 17 replies\n\nBishwambher Jha\n\nUnparliamentary language is dangerous to the society, try healthy statement.\n\n8\n\nMahesh Patel\n\nऐक ओर हरामी आ गया\n\n79\n\nView all 2 replies\n\nDeba Prasad Mohanty\n\nOur ye kiska kaam kar raha hey ??? Pakistan, China, America ka sayad.\n\n19\n\nDileep Kumar Gupta\n\n2029 में मात्र मोदी जी\n\n35\n\nAnkit Thakur\n\nYe sale sab हिन्दुओं को target kar rhye hai MC hai na BC\n\n18","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":2509.002793000036,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}